Tool window stripe icons of the Lithe desktop client.

The SVGs in svg/ are IntelliJ Platform Community New UI tool window icons, downloaded byte for
byte from the JetBrains IntelliJ Platform Community repository
(https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community) at revision
c7f91397daa3a961b4e78bc634fe467a0a7d9ade. Copyright 2000-2025 JetBrains s.r.o. and contributors;
distributed under the Apache License 2.0, see ../fileicons/LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt.

- build, commit, debug, find, notifications, problems, project, run, services, structure and
  vcs @20x20.svg: platform/icons/src/expui/toolwindows/.
- terminal@20x20.svg: plugins/terminal/resources/icons/expui/toolwindow/.

Only the light variants are kept: each @20x20_dark.svg draws the same shapes in another color,
and Lithe tints these icons itself. scripts/desktop/generate-desktop-file-icons.sh turns their
strokes into fills, unions the shapes of each icon into one path and drops the color, so the
compiled icons keep the geometry only.
